{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"type-alias-extractfilterfnkeystfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Alias: ExtractFilterFnKeys<TFeatures>"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type ExtractFilterFnKeys<TFeatures> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ?\n  | keyof FilterFns\n  | BuiltInFilterFn : TFeatures extends object ? Extract<keyof TFilterFns, string> : keyof FilterFns;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-filtering/columnFilteringFeature.types.ts#L165","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/column-filtering/columnFilteringFeature.types.ts:165"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resolves the valid string names for "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"columnDef.filterFn"},{"type":"text","value":" and\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options.globalFilterFn"},{"type":"text","value":" for a feature set."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When the features object declares a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"filterFns"},{"type":"text","value":" registry\n("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tableFeatures({ ..., filterFns })"},{"type":"text","value":"), its keys are the only valid names; a\nname is only assignable if a filter function is actually registered for it.\nOtherwise this falls back to the global declaration-merged "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FilterFns"},{"type":"text","value":"\ninterface."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/TableFeatures.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-alias-extractfilterfnkeystfeatures","text":"Type Alias: ExtractFilterFnKeys<TFeatures>","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Type Alias: ExtractFilterFnKeys\\<TFeatures\\>\n\n```ts\ntype ExtractFilterFnKeys<TFeatures> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ?\n  | keyof FilterFns\n  | BuiltInFilterFn : TFeatures extends object ? Extract<keyof TFilterFns, string> : keyof FilterFns;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-filtering/columnFilteringFeature.types.ts:165](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-filtering/columnFilteringFeature.types.ts#L165)\n\nResolves the valid string names for `columnDef.filterFn` and\n`options.globalFilterFn` for a feature set.\n\nWhen the features object declares a `filterFns` registry\n(`tableFeatures({ ..., filterFns })`), its keys are the only valid names; a\nname is only assignable if a filter function is actually registered for it.\nOtherwise this falls back to the global declaration-merged `FilterFns`\ninterface.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ExtractFilterFnKeys\ntitle: ExtractFilterFnKeys\n---\n\n# Type Alias: ExtractFilterFnKeys\\<TFeatures\\>\n\n```ts\ntype ExtractFilterFnKeys<TFeatures> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ?\n  | keyof FilterFns\n  | BuiltInFilterFn : TFeatures extends object ? Extract<keyof TFilterFns, string> : keyof FilterFns;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-filtering/columnFilteringFeature.types.ts:165](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-filtering/columnFilteringFeature.types.ts#L165)\n\nResolves the valid string names for `columnDef.filterFn` and\n`options.globalFilterFn` for a feature set.\n\nWhen the features object declares a `filterFns` registry\n(`tableFeatures({ ..., filterFns })`), its keys are the only valid names; a\nname is only assignable if a filter function is actually registered for it.\nOtherwise this falls back to the global declaration-merged `FilterFns`\ninterface.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n"}
